package alliance_found

// This guild saga's step consumers are not registered here. roost add saga
// generates this file with a StartSteps / RegisterSteps pair for the common
// case; this demo overwrites it because the steps need what that shape cannot
// know — the Player steps run only on the player's bound sid (admission and a
// handoff to it, from the service's player ownership table and bus), and the
// guild steps call the alliance service through its RPC client.
//
// So the registration lives with the service, in
// internal/service/{{GAME_SERVICE}}/alliance_saga.go (startGuildSagas: one
// kitsaga.Steps for the three guild sagas, against the topic constants in
// definition.go), and the Player steps' Nest handlers are
// game/handler/guild_debit.go and guild_credit.go.
